sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / External Site
    participant Gallery as brochure-gallery (:3004 / :3014)
    participant MW as Middleware (/public/marketing)
    participant Kong as Supabase Kong (:8000)
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant MinIO as MinIO S3 (:9000 / cms-media)

    Browser->>Gallery: GET / or /b/[slug]
    Gallery->>MW: GET /public/marketing/gallery (approved UMKM)
    MW->>PG: studio_marketing_contents + consent
    PG-->>Gallery: Promo cards (imageUrl, caption, …)
    Gallery->>Kong: SELECT tenant_brochures (optional seed)
    Kong->>PG: Tenant brochure rows
    PG-->>Gallery: Merge feed (marketing first)
    Browser->>Gallery: GET /b/m-{contentId} (Konten Marketing permalink)
    Gallery->>MW: GET /public/marketing/gallery/{id}
    MW-->>Gallery: Single approved item
    Browser->>Gallery: GET /api/brochure-svg/[slug] (tenant brochures only)
    Gallery->>MinIO: PutObject cms-media/brochures/[slug].svg
    Gallery-->>Browser: High-res SVG Poster (CORS *)
